# Commit session

When you create a git commit, the body must include:

```text
Session: <conversation_id>
```

`<conversation_id>` is the id from the stop-hook payload, the agent transcript directory name, or a line already written under `.cursor/session-notes/`. If you do not know it, say so and stop. Do not invent one.

Do not `git add` `bots/**/bot.env` or any other credential file.
